=== Multicursor > issue #1336: Insert cursor below on last line adds a cursor to the end of the current line
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null}
text: "abc"
cmd editor.action.insertCursorBelow
expectSelCount 1

=== Multicursor selection > issue #6661: AddSelectionToNextFindMatchAction can work with touching ranges
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null}
text: "abcabc\nabc\nabcabc"
setSelections 1 1 1 4
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
expectRanges 1 1 1 4; 1 4 1 7
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
expectRanges 1 1 1 4; 1 4 1 7; 2 1 2 4; 3 1 3 4; 3 4 3 7
type "z"
expectRanges 1 2 1 2; 1 3 1 3; 2 2 2 2; 3 2 3 2; 3 3 3 3
expectText "zz\nz\nzz"

=== Multicursor selection > AddSelectionToNextFindMatchAction starting with single collapsed selection
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null}
text: "abc pizza\nabc house\nabc bar"
setSelections 1 2 1 2
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
expectSel 1 1 1 4
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
expectSel 1 1 1 4; 2 1 2 4
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
expectSel 1 1 1 4; 2 1 2 4; 3 1 3 4
cmd editor.action.addSelectionToNextFindMatch
expectSel 1 1 1 4; 2 1 2 4; 3 1 3 4

=== Multicursor selection > AddSelectionToNextFindMatchAction starting with two selections, one being collapsed 1)
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null}
text: "abc pizza\nabc house\nabc bar"
